# Xiaohongshu Quantumult X strict IP-consistency mode v2.3.0
# Import as FILTER resource and set Policy Override to: 📤 小红书上传
#
# Purpose: guarantee that all Xiaohongshu API traffic uses the selected exit,
# avoiding missed App-only comment/publish endpoints and recent-session IP attribution.
#
# Media CDN (*.xhscdn.com) is NOT included here and should remain DIRECT.

host-suffix, xiaohongshu.com, proxy
